jsp-816 pack: content licence
=============================

1. Attribution statement

Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government
Licence v3.0.

2. Source identification

Source: JSP 816: Defence Environmental Management System (EMS) Framework
V1.2 Dec 24, with Elements 1-12 (V2.1 Dec 24) and Element 12 Annex A
Environmental Protection Self-Assessment Toolkit, Ministry of Defence
(Director Climate Change and Environment), © Crown copyright.

3. Source links

Publication page:
https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/defence-environmental-management-system-framework-jsp-816

Publication page carries the gov.uk footer sentence: "All content is
available under the Open Government Licence v3.0, except where otherwise
stated" (page fetched 2026-11-22).

4. Licence

Open Government Licence v3.0:
https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/

5. Nature of this pack

This pack contains reconstructed reference notes, not reproductions.
Content was restructured and summarised from the source; passages are
paraphrased except short defined terms.

6. Non-endorsement

Nothing in this pack suggests that the Ministry of Defence endorses it or
that it has any official status.

7. Excluded material

- ISO 14001:2015 standard text (Framework alignment claim only; no ISO clauses).
- MOD crests and logos, and military insignia.
- Spreadsheet cell values/macros from Annex A toolkit files.

8. Scope

This licence governs the content of this pack (SKILL.md, chapters/,
glossary.md, cheatsheet.md, patterns.md). The repository's MIT licence
covers tooling and scaffolding only.

9. Per-source record

Framework PDF: JSP816_EMS_Framework.pdf — used in ch01, ch02
Element 1-12 PDFs: JSP816_Element1.pdf … JSP816_Element12.pdf — used in ch03-ch10
Annex A toolkit ODS/XLSX — method described in ch11 (no cell dump)
